nshu-059-jiong:p002","start":81,"end":86,"surface":"乃收襲殺之"},"date_expression":null,"status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ws2650517-jiong","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002","quote":"冏因眾心怨望，潛與離狐王盛、潁川王處穆謀起兵誅倫。倫遣腹心張烏覘之，烏反，曰：「齊無異志。」冏既有成謀未發，恐或泄，乃與軍司管襲殺處穆，送首於倫，以安其意。謀定，乃收襲殺之。遂與豫州刺史何勖、龍驤將軍董艾等起軍，遣使告成都、河間、常山、新野四王，移檄天下征鎮、州郡縣國，咸使聞知。揚州刺史郗隆承檄，猶豫未決，參軍王邃斬之，送首於冏。冏屯軍陽翟，倫遣其將閭和、張泓、孫輔出堮阪，與冏交戰。冏軍失利，堅壘自守。會成都軍破倫眾于黃橋，冏乃出軍攻和等，大破之。及王輿廢倫，惠帝反正，冏誅討賊党既畢，率眾入洛，頓軍通章署，甲士數十萬，旌旗器械之盛，震於京都。天子就拜大司馬，加九錫之命，備物典策，如宣、景、文、武輔魏故事。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0027"}],"interpretation_note":"僅本篇明載死亡；不以沒于作死亡，不從報齡倒生年。無可綁年者留null。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0024","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"管襲","kind":"person","person_id":"va8_xga_761","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0027","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"襲","kind":"person","person_id":"va8_xga_761","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong:p002:m0062","surface":"管襲","start":62,"end":64,"person_id":"va8_xga_761","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong:p002:m0083","surface":"襲","start":83,"end":84,"person_id":"va8_xga_761","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":